screen.png
*.log
.env

# Release signing — the app's permanent Play Store identity. Lives at the
# project root, not inside android/, because `expo prebuild` deletes and
# regenerates that whole directory from scratch every run (it wipes
# everything untracked there first, gitignored or not) — this already cost
# one copy of the keystore mid-session. Never commit this: losing it is
# unrecoverable once a real Play Store build has shipped with it (can never
# update the app under that listing again), and leaking it lets anyone sign
# a build as this app. Back it up somewhere outside this repo.
/release.keystore
/keystore.properties
